 postgis_raster         | 3.1.2   | public     | PostGIS raster types and functions
 postgis_sfcgal         | 3.1.2   | public     | PostGIS SFCGAL functions
 postgis_tiger_geocoder | 3.1.2   | tiger      | PostGIS tiger geocoder and reverse geocoder
